ザインでもOKです\n\n・使用用途ですが他の人に依頼する際の服装の参考画像として使用したいです\n\n以上です", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 849545, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ミーのん＠36ⅾ（skeb受付中）💯🦂", "screen_name": "menon", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1621841477537263621/s0EPecdp.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/3189876710/1695336625/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 128}, {"id": 1474941, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "🐊", "screen_name": "kinokochan02", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1828257133449879553/z35ruBeD.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1386924544938545153/1729107207/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "novel"}], "nc": 160}, {"id": 1650526, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "あいのすけ。", "screen_name": "AINosuke_031", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1541101378348945408/VMwd7o21.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1437775714544091136/1709743819/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 20, "complete_expiration_days": 50, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 129}, {"id": 2451447, "creator": true, "nsfw_acc